    feat(storage): add insert buffering for FileStorage (#1675)

    * feat(storage): add insert buffering for FileStorage

    - Add insert_buffer HashMap to buffer records before flushing
    - Add buffer_threshold (default 100) to control flush frequency
    - Add enable_buffer flag to enable/disable buffering
    - Add new_with_buffer_config() constructor for configuration
    - Implement insert_direct() for immediate write (single inserts)
    - Implement insert_buffered() for batch writes
    - Implement flush_buffer() and flush_all_buffers()
    - Update insert() to choose strategy based on record count

    Optimization strategy:
    - Single INSERT (< buffer_threshold): direct write (low latency)
    - Batch INSERT (>= buffer_threshold): buffered write (high throughput)

    * test(storage): add insert buffering tests

    - test_insert_buffering: verify buffering works
    - test_insert_buffer_threshold: verify threshold triggers flush
    - test_flush_all_buffers: verify explicit flush works

    159 tests passing

